  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**Logic: Third no. = [(First no. + Second no.) × (First no. - Second no.)]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**(7, 5, 24) →**\n\n​⇒ [(7 + 5) × (7 - 5)]\n\n​⇒ (12 × 2) = 24\n\n**(8, 2, 60) →**\n\n​⇒ [(8 + 2) × (8 - 2)]\n\n​⇒ (10 × 6) = 60\n\nChecking the given options:\n\n**1.** (4, 8, 39) →\n\n​⇒ [(4 + 8) × (4 - 8)]\n\n​⇒ [12 × (-4)] = -48\n\n**2.** (6, 3, 36) →\n\n​⇒ [(6 + 3) × (6 - 3)]\n\n​⇒ (9 × 3) = 27\n\n**3.** **(9, 3, 72) →**\n\n​⇒ [(9 + 3) × (9 - 3)]\n\n​⇒ (12 × 6) = **72**\n\n**4.** (6, 3, 18) →\n\n​⇒ [(6 + 3) × (6 - 3)]\n\n​⇒ (9 × 3) = 27\n\nHere, **(9, 3, 72)** is similar to the given pair of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (3)\".\n\n97:Te50,\n<p style=&",
